        "attribution": "Katori originated the magic-wavelength lattice-clock concept; Ye made essential experimental advances and demonstrations.",
        "maturity": "Independent laboratories have repeatedly reached extraordinary accuracy and established applications in timekeeping and fundamental physics.",
        "uncertainties": [
