        "nobel_worthiness": "qPlus force microscopy and its atomic-resolution molecular imaging made chemical structure and intramolecular contrast experimentally visible with exceptional clarity.",
        "attribution": "Giessibl's qPlus methodology, Meyer’s experimental development, and Gross’s landmark molecular imaging provide a coherent chain of credit.",
        "maturity": "The method is established, reproduced broadly, and has changed what surface scientists can measure directly.",
        "uncertainties": [
